WEBVTT

00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:13,720
Hello, everybody. This is Dr. Conner's and welcome to our frequently asked questions page. Now we don't pretend to know everything. Of course, we don't, but we want to give you our knowledge.

00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:29,720
I really believe that's what what are the purposes that God put me here for as I gain knowledge, which he's given me a hunger for same with Michelle. That's why she's part of this team is that we just hunger for knowledge.

00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:50,720
As we do gain knowledge, I feel like it's our responsibility. And partly, again, that's why God put us here is to try to take that knowledge and turn it into applicable information, not only for cancer patients, but to make it so that it's easily understood.

00:00:50,720 --> 00:01:03,720
How can we glean the data from this these studies and actually utilize it in practice to actually help people. So this is what we try to do. Now we're not trying to be your Google.

00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:12,720
So, you know, when you submit a question, that's what this whole section is for. We're not going to be able to answer all those questions.

00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:30,720
But we're going to try to make some videos, often questions that you can submit to us. So we're asking you to really help us. So give us your frequently asked questions, questions that would be good for others to hear the answer to as well. And we'll give you our opinion.

00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:44,720
If we have an opinion based upon my experience in this. And if we don't, we won't try to tackle that question. But we want you to give us that feedback so we can add those videos.

00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:57,720
So check back to this section on a regular basis, because we'll be constantly adding more content to help people. And thanks to you and your questions. So appreciate it.

00:01:57,720 --> 00:02:08,720
We're constantly growing, constantly learning, constantly giving to others, constantly praying for others. So I asked that you keep that in mind as well. Thanks.

